# Profiles of the catalog's GPU stages, Qwen3-8B on one H100 NVL, 2026-11-09.

## 06_activations.py (recorded from the run's console, no log kept)
forward alone, sdpa: 21.3k tokens/s; eager: 19.4-19.7k; flat in batch size up to 128 documents (peak 17-23 GiB)
with hooks, 32 documents a batch: 8.8k tokens/s, 0.846 s/batch: neuron hook 0.298, of which grid counts 0.182; attention 0.127; qk_norm 0.051; input_norm 0.008
grid counts from a table of every bf16 pattern and top lists redone only for columns with a new entry, 40 batches: 8,998 -> 9,647 tokens/s, identical except float-order rounding in the sums of offset (0.125) and recv (20.0)

